# 1. Ignore everything
*

# 2. But don't ignore directories (so we can look inside them)
!*/

# 3. Explicitly include (track) your requested formats
!*.R
!*.Rmd
!*.slurm
!*.sh
!*.html
!*.py
!*.ipynb

# 3. Now, un-ignore all .txt files in any directory
!**/*.R
!**/*.Rmd
!**/*.html
!**/*.sbatch
!**/*.sh
!**/*.slurm
!**/*.py
!**/*.ipynb

# 4. (Optional) If you want to keep the .gitignore itself tracked
raw/*/**

# Drop Jupyter autosave checkpoints (real notebooks above stay tracked)
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Per-sample executed notebook copies are outputs, not source — keep root ones only
LUT-245-*/**/*.ipynb

# Executed notebook copies / result-dir notebooks are outputs, not source
notebooks_executed/
6.3.integrate_tumour_archetype/*.ipynb

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md

